                "_type": "Diesel Product Detail",
                "about": {
                    "image": {
                        "src": "https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/egs-niohthecompleteedition-koeitecmogamescoltd-s2-1200x1600-5542002a7e29.jpg",
                        "_type": "Diesel Image"
                    },
                    "developerAttribution": "KOEI TECMO GAMES CO., LTD.",
                    "_type": "Diesel Product About",
                    "publisherAttribution": "KOEI TECMO GAMES CO., LTD.",
                    "description": "Ready to die? Experience the newest brutal action game from Team NINJA and Koei Tecmo Games. In the age of samurai, a lone traveler lands on the shores of Japan. He must fight his way through the vicious warriors and supernatural Yokai that infest the land in order to find that which he seeks.\n\n# Product includes:\nDragon of the North\nThis expansion opens up the Tohoku region, where the \"one-eyed dragon\" Date Masamune is secretly gathering spirit stones.\n\nDefiant Honor\nFight your way through the Siege of Osaka's winter campaign as you follow the story of one of Japan's greatest generals from the Warring States period, the brave Sanada Yukimura.\n\nBloodshed's End\nJoin the summer campaign of the Siege of Osaka as the Warring States period draws to a close in this, the final chapter of William's tale.\n\n# PC Features:\n- Gamepad compatibility\n- 4K Ultra-HD support*\n- Cross-play with Steam players\n\n*Requires a monitor/PC components that support these modes.\n\nExclusive Bonus\nAn exclusive \"Fujin Helmet\" you can claim by selecting \"Boons\" from a shrine. \n![Image 1](https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/fujin-helmet-2500x2500-9c5a89d2a7c0.jpg)\n\nPlease note that some online features of this title may be changed or removed in the future.\nPlease visit the official website for more details: https://teamninja-studio.com/nioh/\n\nNioh 2 - The Complete Edition is also available on the Epic Games Store:\nhttps://www.epicgames.com/store/p/nioh-2-the-complete-edition\n\n\n©KOEI TECMO GAMES CO., LTD All rights reserved.\n",
                    "shortDescription": "Ready to die? Experience a brutal action game from Team NINJA and Koei Tecmo Games. In the age of samurai, a lone traveler must fight his way through the vicious warriors and supernatural Yokai that infest the land in order to find that which he seeks. ",
